      'about.eyebrow': '<span class="jp">自己紹介</span>About me',
      'about.h2': 'Code is the means. <span class="g">A system running is the result.</span>',
      'about.cap': 'full-stack · Brazil',
      'about.issue': 'ISSUE 2026 · NO. 01',
      'about.p1': 'I\'m a full-stack developer working end to end: the scraper that collects, the engine that analyzes, the dashboard that decides and the infrastructure that keeps it all running. Designing, building and <b>operating</b> the same product changes how you write every layer.',
      'about.quote': 'Uptime isn\'t promised. <span class="g">It\'s built, every day.</span>',
      'about.p5': 'If this way of working makes sense for your project, <b>the conversation starts just below</b>.',
      'about.p2': 'Today I maintain <b>30+ systems in production</b>, with 160+ containers across three servers, monitored 24/7. Operating on my own taught me to take availability seriously: every project ships with healthchecks, logs and a plan for when something fails.',
      'about.p3': 'Building software was never just a job. It\'s the curiosity of the kid who took things apart, now with the care of knowing real people depend on what I ship.',
      'about.p4': 'Before code there was music: I\'m a musician and a former guitar teacher. From that life I brought the discipline of daily practice and the habit of explaining complex things simply, and both show up in every project I do.',

      'contact.eyebrow': '<span class="jp">接続</span>Let\'s build',
